From: Ayushman Chhabra <14110965+ayushmanchhabra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:44:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Draw lazily generated window icons before sending them on
 Wayland

SetIcon() only sent the icon's existing representations, so resized,
badged and loading app icons arrived empty and replaced the window's
icon. X11 draws them with GetRepresentation().

Refs: nwjs/nw.js#8397
---
 ui/ozone/platform/wayland/host/xdg_toplevel.cc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ui/ozone/platform/wayland/host/xdg_toplevel.cc b/ui/ozone/platform/wayland/host/xdg_toplevel.cc
index c85b59a99..ce0d1d6d5 100644
--- a/ui/ozone/platform/wayland/host/xdg_toplevel.cc
+++ b/ui/ozone/platform/wayland/host/xdg_toplevel.cc
@@ -354,6 +354,7 @@ void XdgToplevel::SetIcon(const gfx::ImageSkia& icon) {
     return;
   }
 
+  icon.EnsureRepsForSupportedScales();
   std::vector<std::pair<WaylandShmBuffer, float>> buffers;
   auto* xdg_icon = xdg_toplevel_icon_manager_v1_create_icon(manager);
   for (const auto& rep : icon.image_reps()) {
-- 
